      that it is.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>What anyone opening the link may do with it</strong>: run it at their table, and,
      where the license on a creature permits reuse, add that creature to their own library in the
      app. That is the point of a shared link, and it needs no further permission from you. Anything
