      the same as a byline. If your account has a default license, it pre-fills the choice when you publish,
      and what applies is whatever the publish dialog showed you.
    </p>
    <p>
      A byline is your own claim and is shown as you typed it. We do not verify it. Do not publish
      under a name suggesting the encounter comes from us, from Wizards of the Coast, or from anyone
      else you are not.
    </p>
    <p>
      A link can stop working. You can take down your own at any time, and we can remove anything
      that breaks these terms. Nobody has a right to continued hosting, and a link is not a promise
      that what it points to will still be there. Nothing expires on its own: a page stays up until
